Adventurer,

It=E2=80=99s the height of Carnival season, and a new referral season has b=
egun! From now until April 1, referring a friend can get you the brand-new =
*Jester Horse* ( https://albiononline.com/news/jester-horse ) mount skin. I=
n jovial red and white attire, this skin for your *Riding* *Horse base moun=
t* comes with its own cap and bells, drawing attention from passersby as yo=
u trot through the streets of Albion. And once you've unlocked the skin, it=
 can be used by *all characters* on your account.

The current referral season lasts until maintenance on *April 1* , so you'v=
e got until then to refer your friends and claim these rewards!

( https://albiononline.com/news/carnival-challenge-2022 )

The Carnival Challenge Returns
------------------------------

Alongside the referral season, the *Carnival Challenge* ( https://albiononl=
ine.com/news/carnival-challenge-2022 ) is back! For the entire month of Feb=
ruary you can earn Challenge Points, claim valuable rewards and themed furn=
iture items, and unlock the speedy *Saddled Terrorbird*.

As always, you can earn Challenge Points by *gathering, fishing, farming, a=
nd killing monsters*. Points count toward a daily bonus, a weekly unlockabl=
e chest, and the monthly mount and avatar ring reward. So log in, head out =
into the open world, and claim these rewards while they last!

( https://albiononline.com/news/shadowcat )

Prowl Through the Shadows
-------------------------

The beautiful new Shadowcat skin is now available in the in-game store! Thi=
s skin for your Swiftclaw base mount is perfect for tearing across the open=
 world or stalking stealthily through Albion=E2=80=99s cities. Check it out=
 here:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/shadowcat )

